WEBVTT

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:03.762
Meera (fictional) studied every day: videos,

00:00:03.762 --> 00:00:06.737
problems at night, a weekend project.

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:09.425
Then the interview asked her to

00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:10.412
connect it all.

00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:12.772
Her effort was real.

00:00:12.772 --> 00:00:14.472
It just wasn't connected.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.327
Placiq. So your effort adds up.
